                "html": "<section class=\"sec-editorial bg-img-features\" id=\"profit-angle-2\">\n    <div class=\"overlay-layer overlay-slate-cool\"></div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"feature-split-grid\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/kdp-mafia/assets/feature_market.png\" alt=\"Done-For-You Client Book Agency\" class=\"feature-img-frame\" style=\"border-color: var(--blue-cobalt);\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"eyebrow-badge\">PROFIT ANGLE 02: CLIENT AGENCY</div>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">Charge Clients $500–$2,000 Per Custom Book</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink-body); margin-bottom: 22px; line-height: 1.8;\">\n            Commercial License included — offer done-for-you publishing packages to coaches, local business owners, and influencers while KDP Profit Machine handles 95% of the labor.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"card-panel text-left\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-left: 4px solid var(--blue-cobalt);\">\n            <div style=\"font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--blue-cobalt);\" class=\"mono-spec\">⚡ COMMERCIAL AGENCY ADVANTAGE:</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 6px;\">Deliver complete paperback layout files, wraparound covers, and Amazon listings in under 24 hours while keeping 100% client profit.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
